&lt;h2&gt;Fixed&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;File editor&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Restore CJK input-method composition and candidate selection in file editor panes. Keep the caret, selection and candidate window aligned with shaped text, including emoji and horizontally scrolled CJK lines. Undo a completed composition in one step and clear composition state when leaving the editor.&lt;span class="credit"&gt;PR &lt;a href="https://github.com/nowledge-co/con-terminal/pull/555"&gt;#555&lt;/a&gt; by &lt;a href="https://github.com/wey-gu"&gt;@wey-gu&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
